# Source sprite contact sheets are large (1.5-2MB each) and change rarely.
# LFS keeps them out of the repo's object history while staying versioned.
# The generated strips in src/assets/sprites are committed normally — they are
# what the app loads, and the deploy build must not depend on fetching LFS.
assets/images/sprites/**/*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
